        "contenuto_esteso": "President Trump said on Sunday that Israel “won’t have any choice\" but to accept any potential deal to end the war with Iran. \"I call the shots. I call all the shots. He doesn't call the shots,” Trump said in a phone interview with the Financial Times, referring to Israeli Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu. The..."
